        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Seksyen 2 Akta Tanah (Kawasan Penempatan"
      },
      "schema:text": {
        "@language": "ms",
        "@value": "Berkelompok) 1960 adalah dipinda dengan meng- gantikan takrif \"Minister\" dengan yang berikut: \"Minister\" means the Minister charged with responsibility for the Development Authority except for the purpose of section 44 (1), it means the Minister charged with the responsibility in respect thereof if it is so notified by an order made by the Yang di-Pertuan Agong under the Ministerial Functions Act 1969;'."
